+   * info.eew, and outEew only supports vsew / vsew + 1, while vdot goes from e8
+   * sources to e32 results (two levels apart). Mask / tail are resolved here on
+   * 32-bit destination elements:
+   *   - vl counts source bytes, so #destination elements = ceil(vl / 4)
+   *   - destination element i is enabled by v0[i] when vm = 0
+   *   - masked-off / tail elements follow vma / vta (1 -> all ones, 0 -> old vd)
+   * ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
+  private val isVdot = inCtrl.fuOpType === VialuFixType.vdot_vv
